flowchart LR
    Operator["Operator"]
    Agent["Agent / Client"]
    Bootstrap["Local Skill Preflight"]
    SkillRegistry["Locked Skill Registry"]
    SkillRoutes["Task-matched Skill Routes"]
    HermesRole["Hermes Research Coordinator\nCodex V2 read-only"]
    HermesPreflight["Hermes Contract Preflight"]
    HermesAdapter["Optional Loopback Adapter\ncontract-only by default"]
    HermesRuntime["Hermes Research Profiles"]
    HermesReceipt["Evidence Receipt\nprovenance + readback"]
    Control["Agent Control Plane"]
    Core["Application Core Services"]
    DeviceAdapter["Device Adapters"]
    CloudAdapter["Cloud Adapters"]
    Device["Physical Devices"]
    Cloud["Cloud Services"]
    State["Local State / Cache"]
    Snapshot["Snapshots"]
    Audit["Audit / Metrics"]
    VueShell["Vue Route Shell"]
    Mock["MSW Local Fixtures"]
    Session["Local Demo Session"]
    DryRun["Local Dry-run Receipt"]

    Operator --> Agent
    Agent -->|task start| Bootstrap
    Bootstrap -->|local-only index| SkillRegistry
    Agent -->|discover project skills| SkillRegistry
    SkillRegistry --> SkillRoutes
    SkillRoutes -->|route constraints| Control
    SkillRoutes --> HermesRole
    HermesRole --> HermesPreflight
    HermesPreflight -.->|explicit probe| HermesAdapter
    HermesAdapter -.->|bounded read-only delegation| HermesRuntime
    HermesPreflight --> HermesReceipt
    HermesRuntime --> HermesReceipt
    HermesReceipt --> Control
    Operator --> VueShell
    VueShell -->|typed observation capability| Control
    Agent -->|typed capability request| Control
    Control -->|validated command| Core
    Core --> DeviceAdapter
    Core --> CloudAdapter
    DeviceAdapter --> Device
    CloudAdapter --> Cloud
    Core --> State
    Core --> Snapshot
    Control --> Audit
    Core --> Audit
    State -.->|read-only fallback| Control
    VueShell --> Mock
    Mock -->|fixture readback| VueShell
    VueShell --> Session
    VueShell --> DryRun
    DryRun --> Audit
